<title>USA: Howell requests halt, plans announcement.</title>
<headline>Howell requests halt, plans announcement.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Howell Corp said Wednesday it asked the New York Stock Exchange to halt trading in its shares pending a material announcement the company expected to make at around 1200 EDT/1600 GMT.</p>
<p>A spokesman said the company's board was meeting this morning and the announcement come &quot;at around noon&quot; after the meeting concluded.</p>
<p>Howell Corp is an energy company engaged in oil and gas exploration and production, and petrochemicals.</p>
